  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 704.04 Payment for the Testing and Monitoring Fees. Payment for the testing and monitoring fees shall be submitted to the department within 60 days of the billing date.\n\nSource. #7880, eff 4-26-03; ss by #9911, eff 4-26-1; ss by #12649, eff 10-24-18",
